    {
      "id": "claim_757d0ddc8ac34c209ce368d88f389958",
      "statement": "Timing defaults are a 24 h refresh (DEFAULT_CATALOG_REFRESH_MS) and a 15 min retry (DEFAULT_CATALOG_RETRY_MS); production main.ts enables warmTransitCatalogs and reads TRANSIT_CATALOG_REFRESH_MS from env, where loadEnv clamps it to between 60 s and 7 days (default 24 h); retryMs, the minimums, and random are not env-configurable.",
