    {
      "id": "claim_11c2deb6e56b486384d8844eefc32383",
      "statement": "The bus loader strips the upstream diffMeter (a distance from the fixed catalog center, meaningless for a user query) and dedupes the citywide response through a Map keyed by String(stop.id); the subway loader returns the CSV-normalized SubwayStationPoint rows unchanged.",
      "evidence": [
