    {
      "id": "claim_edf7742200244ee5846584af923865f0",
      "statement": "Query-time semantics differ per mode: bus nearby annotates each point with haversine distance, filters to distanceMeters <= radius, sorts by distance then String(id) localeCompare as a stable tiebreak, and rounds distances; subway nearby filters to radius, then dedupes by station name keeping the nearest point per name (the CSV has one row per line, so transfer stations repeat) and sorts by distance then Korean-name localeCompare.",
      "evidence": [
