    {
      "id": "claim_72e1c3b0b63748aba43b8f1329ade5ff",
      "statement": "Every load emits a CatalogEvent through the shared onEvent callback, logged as one JSON line keyed event: transit_catalog_refresh with source, trigger, outcome, durationMs (performance.now around the loader), itemCount (the surviving snapshot's size on failure, not zero), nextRefreshAt, and detail — failures at logger.warn and successes at logger.log; the trigger string (warmup, cold-request, stale-request, scheduled, manual) records why the load ran.",
